                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is a masterclass in level design. The environments are believable, incredibly detailed and expansive, and the layouts and puzzles are intelligently planned and executed, not to mention how impressive it all is for being a game developed in the Source engine. Gameplay-wise it is a very straightforward game, but it is a really immersive game that you don't just play, you experience it. There is a lot of details beyond the critical path of the player that are easy to miss, which sometimes are entire additional levels. If you like to explore and look into every nook and cranny then this game is a great choice - I was very exhaustive in my playthrough and I still missed things. I wish I could play it all over again for the first time, I remember it as if I had been there.",
